## Field Descriptions

### Core Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `spec_id` | string | ✓ | Unique specification identifier |
| `project_id` | string | ✓ | Project reference |
| `dataset_id` | string | ✓ | Dataset reference |
| `description` | string | ✓ | Human-readable description |
| `row_indicators` | array | ✓ | Row dimension indicators |
| `column_indicators` | array | ✓ | Column dimension indicators |
| `weight_indicator` | string | ✓ | Weighting variable name |
| `display_options` | object | ✓ | Output formatting options |
| `chart_config` | object | ✓ | Chart configuration |

### Indicator Object Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `indicator_code` | string | ✓ | Variable name in SPSS file |
| `indicator_label` | string | ✓ | Question text |
| `question_type` | enum | ✓ | Single, MultiSelect, Frequency, Rating, Matrix, Ranking, Numeric |
| `explicit` | array or null | ✓ | Specific values or null |
| `settings_template` | string | ✓ | Template: categorical or scalar |

### display_options Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `table_format` | string | compact, full, wide |
| `empty_display` | string | ZERO, BLANK, custom |
| `missing_display` | string | Custom missing value text |
| `variable_labels` | string | DEFAULT, NAME, LABEL, BOTH, NONE |
| `hide_empty_rows` | boolean | Hide zero-count rows |
| `hide_empty_columns` | boolean | Hide zero-count columns |
| `sort_by` | string | label, count |

### chart_config Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `chart_type` | string | stacked_bar, grouped_bar, heatmap, mosaic, none |
| `color_scheme` | string | Color palette name |
| `show_labels` | boolean | Show data labels |
| `show_legend` | boolean | Show chart legend |
| `title_template` | string | Title with {row}, {column} placeholders |

## Notes

- Simple structure: crosstab spec references table-settings.json for templates
- 10 fields total
- row_indicators and column_indicators define dimensions
- display_options and chart_config define output formatting
- filter_clause defines data filtering

